  "text": "Maqam Jiharkah (not part of a maqam family) Maqam Index Pronunciation of Jiharkah Click the notes and hold using the mouse to hear them play. Maqam Jiharkah is a somewhat rare maqam that starts with Jins Jiharkah on the tonic , then Jins Upper Rast on the 5 th degree (with its tonic up on the 8 th degree). Maqam Jiharkah is not part of a maqam family. Watch a 1-minute sample Violin Taqsim in Maqam Jiharkah by Sami Abu Shumays. Muwashah Kallili ya Suhbu Abdel Halim Noueira Ensemble Music by Muhammad ‘Uthman Dawr Ya Ma'nta Wahishni Sabah Fakhri Music by Muhammad ‘Uthman Dawr ‘Ishna w Shufna Saleh Abdel Hayy Music by Muhammad ‘Uthman Sama‘i Jiharkah Sabah Fakhri Orchestra Live Au Théatre Des Amandiers Dulab Jiharkah Sabah Fakhri Orchestra Live Au Théatre Des Amandiers ‘al-Rozana Sabah Fakhri Live Au Théatre Des Amandiers",
